# Arabic RTL UI

- Root / page containers: `dir="rtl"` and `lang="ar"` when the screen is Arabic
- Font: Cairo (`font-family: 'Cairo', 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif`)
- All labels, buttons, placeholders, empty states, and errors in Arabic
- Mirror spacing utilities for RTL (e.g. icons: `right-3`, password toggle: `left-3`)
- Brand tone: navy `#1e2a38` + gold `#9e7e3a` for suits-shop feel; avoid purple/indigo defaults

```jsx
// ✅ GOOD
<label htmlFor="email">البريد الإلكتروني</label>

// ❌ BAD
<label htmlFor="email">Email</label>
```
